{
  "framework": "event-verb-receivers",
  "language": "typescript",
  "dirs": [
    "."
  ],
  "note": "LA.39. The string-keyed event needles `.on(` / `.addEventListener(` / `.addListener(` and `.emit(` / `.dispatch(` / `.trigger(` / `dispatchEvent(` (parsers/code/extractors/src/eventbus.rs EMITTER_PATTERNS / HANDLER_PATTERNS) mint an EVENT_* node for the first call in any file whatever the receiver: Leaflet `map.on('zoomend')`, DOM `addEventListener('click' | 'scroll')`, jQuery `.on('change')` / `.trigger('submit')`, a Redux store `dispatch({type})`, `window.dispatchEvent(...)`, an Angular @Output `this.picked.emit(url)` and a Python `debouncer.trigger()` all read as in-process events (quokka-stack mints event_handle:zoomend / click / scroll / change / load and event_emit:dispatch / emit; repo-graph event_emit:trigger). They now count only on a bus-shaped receiver (bus/orders.ts, bus/notify.ts), an emitter constructed in the same file from an emitter library (worker/jobs.ts), or `this` inside an emitter subclass (lib/uploader.ts) - the controls. No cells binding: a precision guard.",
  "expect_nodes": [
    {
      "kind": "EVENT_EMITTER",
      "name": "event_emit:orderPlaced",
      "note": "bus.emit - bus-shaped receiver"
    },
    {
      "kind": "EVENT_HANDLER",
      "name": "event_handle:orderPlaced",
      "note": "bus.on - bus-shaped receiver"
    },
    {
      "kind": "EVENT_EMITTER",
      "name": "event_emit:drained",
      "note": "jobs.emit - `const jobs = new EventEmitter()` from node:events"
    },
    {
      "kind": "EVENT_HANDLER",
      "name": "event_handle:drained",
      "note": "jobs.on - same bound emitter"
    },
    {
      "kind": "EVENT_EMITTER",
      "name": "event_emit:uploaded",
      "note": "this.emit inside `class Uploader extends EventEmitter`"
    }
  ],
  "expect_edges": [
